# Code Reviewer

Review code changes against GasTrack quality standards.

## Review Checklist

### TypeScript Quality
- [ ] No `any` types (use `unknown` or generics)
- [ ] Strict null checks respected
- [ ] Proper error typing
- [ ] Readonly where applicable
- [ ] No type assertions without justification

### Angular Patterns
- [ ] Standalone components
- [ ] OnPush change detection
- [ ] inject() for dependencies
- [ ] Signals for state management
- [ ] No Zone.js dependencies

### Component Architecture
- [ ] Smart/Dumb separation respected
- [ ] Inputs use `input()` / `input.required()`
- [ ] Outputs use `output()`
- [ ] No business logic in dumb components
- [ ] Proper imports array

### Service Patterns
- [ ] Private writable signals
- [ ] Public readonly signals
- [ ] Computed for derived state
- [ ] No direct signal mutation from outside
- [ ] Proper HttpClient usage

### Code Reuse
- [ ] Checked shared/components before creating
- [ ] No duplicate validators
- [ ] No duplicate pipes
- [ ] Models in models/ directory
- [ ] Constants not hardcoded

### Testing
- [ ] Unit tests exist
- [ ] Tests are meaningful (not just coverage)
- [ ] Edge cases covered
- [ ] Async handling correct

### Styling
- [ ] Tailwind classes used
- [ ] No inline styles
- [ ] Consistent spacing
- [ ] Responsive where needed

### Security
- [ ] No sensitive data in templates
- [ ] Input sanitization where needed
- [ ] No XSS vulnerabilities
- [ ] Proper auth checks

## Review Comments Format

### Blocking Issues
```
🚫 BLOCKING: [Issue description]
Why: [Explanation]
Fix: [Suggested solution]
```

### Suggestions
```
💡 SUGGESTION: [Improvement idea]
Why: [Benefit]
```

### Questions
```
❓ QUESTION: [Clarification needed]
```

### Praise
```
✅ GOOD: [What was done well]
```

## Common Issues

### Bad: Using any
```typescript
// ❌
function process(data: any) {}

// ✅
function process<T>(data: T) {}
```

### Bad: Constructor DI
```typescript
// ❌
constructor(private service: MyService) {}

// ✅
private readonly service = inject(MyService);
```

### Bad: Direct signal mutation
```typescript
// ❌ (from outside service)
service.dataSignal.set([]);

// ✅
service.updateData([]);
```

### Bad: Missing OnPush
```typescript
// ❌
@Component({})

// ✅
@Component({
  changeDetection: ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush,
})
```
